\b FS Platform Model Handover V1.0.4 Pre-V1.5 Interface Cleanup \b0\par
\par
\b Positioning \b0\par
This document records the pre-V1.5 interface-cleanup revision on top of the current V1.0.4 baseline. It does not rebuild the project and does not introduce V1.5 tire proxy logic.\par
\par
\b Core Conclusions \b0\par
1. Standard cases now provide active fields explicitly instead of relying on autofill warnings.\par
2. Formal tire inputs are unified under tire.mode, ktFront, ktRear, ktFrontRange, and ktRearRange.\par
3. sus.kt remains only as a backward-compatibility path.\par
4. Baseline, target, and demo cases no longer emit Auto-filled missing fields or sus.kt deprecated warnings during normal runs.\par
5. shock/wheel consistency warning is retained for abnormal cases, but standard cases should remain clean.\par
